# Stable spec ID: iba-paper-plane. Source checked 2026-10-12. Machine generated; not human reviewed.

::ingredients
(bourbon) 30 ml
(amaro @ Nonino) 30 ml
(bitter aperitif @ Aperol) 30 ml
(lemon: juice, fresh) 30 ml

::equipment
(cocktail shaker)
(cocktail glass)

::instructions
{drink} = (bourbon) + (amaro @ Nonino) + (bitter aperitif @ Aperol) + (lemon: juice, fresh)
{drink} <shake, with ice in (cocktail shaker)> <strain, into a chilled (cocktail glass)>

